{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nあなたの私物にサインしちゃいます！会。\nでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も\n各メンバー5名ずつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\nベースボールシャツ、チケットホルダー、生誕記念Tシャツ、ジャケ写、リクエストアワーのチケット\nにサインしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は\nオフィシャルグッズ率高かったですね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たったみなさん\nおめでとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事にしてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n個別握手会です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すべらない鉄板ネタある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな時、何してる時にラジオを聴く？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\nここ最近握手会ありすぎてネタがないとき\n答えを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服地獄 とりあえず一段落ですかね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は乃木ののです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"富士急ハイランドでやった\n公開録音の時のだね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオで伝わるか不安になる内容だったけど\nどう編集されてるのか楽しみ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会中にはなりますが\n合間に聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/13/9336093/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文化放送\n11月13日（日）18時から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}